An indented quote prefix keeps an invisible plus follower in its host

```
> > a
 > +
 > {x}
 > b
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>
    <p>a</p>
    <p x="">b</p>
  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
```

```
> > a
 > +
 > %% c
 > b
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>
    <p>a</p>
    <p>b</p>
  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
```

```
> > a
 > +
 > [r]: /u
 > b
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>
    <p>a</p>
    <p>b</p>
  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
```
